"kind":"person","person_id":"udw_6ta_ofn","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line055","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-jinshu093-chupou-guhe-short-name","person_id":"udw_6ta_ofn","surfaces":["和","顧和"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-jinshu-093-chupou"],"status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"high","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context","target_mention_ids":["c-jinshu-093-chupou:line055:m0124","c-jinshu-093-chupou:line055:m0137"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-093","source_id":"s-jinshu-093-chupou","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-093-chupou:line055","quote":"永和初，復徵裒，將以為揚州、錄尚書事。吏部尚書劉遐說裒曰：「會稽王令德，國之周公也，足下宜以大政付之。」裒長史王胡之亦勸焉，於是固辭歸籓，朝野咸嘆服之。進號征北大將軍、開府儀同三司，固辭開府。裒又以政道在於得才，宜委賢任能，升敬舊齒，乃薦前光祿大夫顧和、侍中殷浩。疏奏，即以和為尚書令，浩為揚州刺史。"}],"rationale":"薦顧和、殷浩後即以和為尚書令，和承顧和；永和年號中的和不是人名，不作人物標記。","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-064-simachong:p001","text":"東海哀王沖，字道讓。元帝以東海王越世子毗沒于石勒，不知存亡，乃以沖繼毗後，稱東海世子，以毗陵郡增本封邑萬戶，又改食下邳、蘭陵，以越妃裴氏為太妃，拜長水校尉。高選僚佐，以沛國劉耽為司馬，潁川庾懌為功曹，吳郡顧和為主簿。永昌初，遷中軍將軍，加散騎常侍。及東海太妃薨，因發毗喪。沖即王位，以滎陽益東海國，轉車騎將軍，徙驃騎將軍。咸康七年薨，年三十一，贈侍中、驃騎大將軍、儀同三司，無子。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":72,"last_line":72,"raw_start":3997,"raw_end":4196,"raw_character_offsets":[3999,4000,4001,4002,4003,4004,4005,4006,4007,4008,4009,4010,4011,4012,4013,4014,4015,4016,4017,4018,4019,4020,4021,4022,4023,4024,4025,4026,4027,4028,4029,4030,4031,4032,4033,4034,4035,4036,4037,4038,4039,4040,4041,4042,4043,4044,4045,4046,4047,4048,4049,4050,4051,4052,4053,4054,4055,4056,4057,4058,4059,4060,4061,4062,4063,4064,4065,4066,4067,4068,4069,4070,4071,4072,4073,4074,4075,4076,4077,4078,4079,4080,4081,4